-| **DISABLE_MQTT**                       | Disables the MQTT feature if `true`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              | false                                                                                                                                                               |
-| **MQTT_HOST**                          | Hostname of the broker (**required** unless DISABLE_MQTT is `true`)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |                                                                                                                                                                     |
-| **MQTT_PORT**                          | Port of the broker                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | 1883 (8883 for MQTT over TLS)                                                                                                                                       |
-| **MQTT_USERNAME**                      | Username                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |                                                                                                                                                                     |
